1Sa 22:1 , Companies resort unto David at Adullam;
1Sa 22:3 , At Mizpeh he commends his parents unto the king of Moab;
1Sa 22:5 , Admonished by Gad, he comes to Hareth;
1Sa 22:6 , Saul going to pursue him, complains of his servants' unfaithfulness;
1Sa 22:9 , Doeg accuses Ahimelech;
1Sa 22:11 , Saul commands to kill the priests;
1Sa 22:17 , The footmen refusing, Doeg executes it;
1Sa 22:20 , Abiathar escaping, brings David the news.
